!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/fixtures/meta-text-enum.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/2026/39/m/meta.tn"
@doc:"""
  A meta layer declaring an enum constructor whose members may contain a space. `text_identifier` is a second
  identifier family, and `text_enum` pins it as `name_type`, a slot the kernel types `meta.identifier_ref`: the names
  of the types built with `identifier_type`. `text_identifier` is one, in this schema's closure, so the pin is a
  member and the meta layer loads.
  """
!schema {
  text_identifier => !unicode.identifier_type { continue_add: " " }
  text_enum       => meta.enum_type ^ { name_type?: = text_identifier }
}
